        "Now mince the lamb — a small food processor does this easily. Mince the lamb fat along with it; it looks unpromising and it is exactly what makes the filling juicy. Lamb fat does not simply melt away in the steam the way you might hope, so mincing it finely is what gets it evenly through the filling.",
