        "Put the leaves on a cutting board and cut out the tough stalks — keep those too. Cut the largest leaves in half.",
        "Put a heaping tablespoon of filling in the middle of each leaf in a short cylinder. Fold the ends over the filling, then roll it up tightly, like a very small burrito.",
        "Put all the discarded cabbage leaves and stalks in the bottom of a stockpot. It seems strange, but you are building a steamer: the scraps are the base and the dolma sit on them. Place the dolma carefully on that bed.",
